Your entropy bleeds into the world around you. On having entropic backlash applied or increased to you, [1, 1, 2, 2, 3 (TL1-5)] random enemies you can see within radius 10 will be shrouded in entropic forces for 8 turns. This increases the duration of new negative effects and reduces the duration of new beneficial effects applied to the target by [4%, 19%, 27%, 32%, 36% (TL1-5)].
